<title>USA: Diamond Home raises share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Diamond Home raises share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>WOODSTOCK, Ill. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diamond Home Services Inc said Tuesday its board of directors has increased the number of shares it is authorized to repurchase to one million from 500,000.</p>
<p>The company has purchased a total of 452,300 shares at prices ranging from 7-5/8 to 11 since it said on April 30 it would repurchase up to 500,000 shares, Diamond Home said.</p>
<p>Diamond Home shares closed up 1/4 at 7-7/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
